Source:   https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/p/pyyaml/pyyaml-6.0.3.tar.gz
SHA-256:  d76623373421df22fb4cf8817020cbb7ef15c725b9d5e45f17e189bfc384190f
Released: 2025-09-25

Files: every lib/yaml/*.py of the sdist except cyaml.py (the libyaml C-extension binding), plus the
sdist's LICENSE. The files are byte-identical to the sdist; no line is changed. Every import inside
the package is relative, so no import path needed rewriting, and the missing cyaml.py is absorbed by
the package's own `try: from .cyaml import *` / `except ImportError` (`__with_libyaml__` is False).

Only agentfile_lint/frontmatter.py imports this package (tests/test_architecture.py checks it).

To re-fetch and compare:
  curl -sSLO https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/p/pyyaml/pyyaml-6.0.3.tar.gz
  shasum -a 256 pyyaml-6.0.3.tar.gz
  tar xzf pyyaml-6.0.3.tar.gz
  diff -r --exclude=cyaml.py --exclude=__pycache__ --exclude=LICENSE --exclude=PROVENANCE \
      pyyaml-6.0.3/lib/yaml agentfile_lint/_yaml
  cmp pyyaml-6.0.3/LICENSE agentfile_lint/_yaml/LICENSE
